o<mapper-move> sub
(Arguments XYZ; actions: 0 guarded transfer, 1 release, 2 coarse touch, 3 fine touch, 4 upward withdrawal, 5 full outline backoff; feed.)
(X increasing: physical LEFT / LinuxCNC +X; decreasing: physical RIGHT / LinuxCNC -X.)
#<_mp_fx> = #<_x>
#<_mp_fy> = #<_y>
#<_mp_fz> = #<_z>
#<_mp_tx> = #1
#<_mp_ty> = #2
#<_mp_tz> = #3
#<_mp_feed> = #5
#<_mp_stage> = -1
#<mx> = [#1 + #<_mp_ox>]
#<my> = [#2 + #<_mp_oy>]
#<mz> = [#3 + #<_mp_oz>]
o<mm_limits> if [[#<mx> LE #<_ini[axis_x]min_limit>] OR [#<mx> GE #<_ini[axis_x]max_limit>] OR [#<my> LE #<_ini[axis_y]min_limit>] OR [#<my> GE #<_ini[axis_y]max_limit>] OR [#<mz> LE #<_ini[axis_z]min_limit>] OR [#<mz> GE #<_ini[axis_z]max_limit>]]
    (ABORT,Mapper endpoint reaches a configured travel boundary. Abort then Pendant Mode. No clipped target was used.)
o<mm_limits> endif
o<mm_plate> if [[#1 LT [#<_mp_x_min>-0.000000001]] OR [#1 GT [#<_mp_x_max>+0.000000001]] OR [#2 LT [#<_mp_y_min>-0.000000001]] OR [#2 GT [#<_mp_y_max>+0.000000001]]]
    (ABORT,Mapper target is outside the retained plate envelope. No substituted target issued; Abort then Pendant Mode.)
o<mm_plate> endif
o<mm_floor> if [[#3 LT [#<_mp_floor> - 0.000000001]] OR [#3 GT [#<_mp_clear> + 0.000000001]]]
    (ABORT,Mapper target exceeds the original starting-Z descent envelope. Abort then Pendant Mode.)
o<mm_floor> endif
o<mm_uplift> if [#4 EQ 4]
    o<mm_uplift_direction> if [[ABS[#1 - #<_x>] GT [0.5 / ABS[#<_ini[joint_0]scale>]]] OR [ABS[#2 - #<_y>] GT [0.5 / ABS[#<_ini[joint_1]scale>]]] OR [#3 LT [#<_z> - #<_mp_step_z> / 2]]]
        (ABORT,Upward withdrawal requires unchanged XY and a nondecreasing Z target. Abort then Pendant Mode.)
    o<mm_uplift_direction> endif
    o<mm_clearance> if [ABS[#3-#<_mp_clear>] GT [#<_mp_step_z>/2]]
        (ABORT,Upward withdrawal differs from starting clearance. Abort then Pendant Mode.)
    o<mm_clearance> endif
    o<mapper-withdraw> call [#1] [#2] [#3] [#5]
    o<mapper-move> return
o<mm_uplift> endif
o<mm_outline_backoff> if [#4 EQ 5]
    o<mm_outline_path> if [[#<_mp_phase> LT 6] OR [#<_mp_phase> GT 9] OR [ABS[#3-#<_z>] GT [#<_mp_step_z>/2]]]
        (ABORT,Outline backoff must follow a retained contact at fixed Z. Abort then Pendant Mode.)
    o<mm_outline_path> endif
    o<mapper-withdraw> call [#1] [#2] [#3] [#5]
    o<mapper-move> return
o<mm_outline_backoff> endif
o<mm_release> if [#4 EQ 1]
    #<up_release> = [[ABS[#1 - #<_x>] LE [0.5 / ABS[#<_ini[joint_0]scale>]]] AND [ABS[#2 - #<_y>] LE [0.5 / ABS[#<_ini[joint_1]scale>]]] AND [#3 GT #<_z>]]
    o<mm_release_active> while [#<_hal[motion.probe-input]> NE 0]
        #<_mp_fx> = #<_x>
        #<_mp_fy> = #<_y>
        #<_mp_fz> = #<_z>
        #<previous_z> = #<_z>
        (Reverse the approach: physical RIGHT / LinuxCNC -X; physical LEFT / LinuxCNC +X; vertical release is +Z.)
        G38.5 X#1 Y#2 Z#3 F#5
        #<released> = #5070
        o<mm_release_record> if [[#<up_release> EQ 1] AND [#<released> EQ 1]]
            o<mapper-record> call [8]
        o<mm_release_record> else
            o<mapper-record> call [2]
        o<mm_release_record> endif
        o<mm_release_failed> if [[#<released> NE 1] OR [[#<up_release> EQ 0] AND [#<_hal[motion.probe-input]> NE 0]]]
            (ABORT,Probe did not release along its return path. Captures are retained. Abort then Pendant Mode.)
        o<mm_release_failed> endif
        o<mm_release_progress> if [[#<up_release> EQ 1] AND [#<_hal[motion.probe-input]> NE 0] AND [[#<_z> LE #<previous_z>] OR [#<_z> GE #3]]]
            (ABORT,Upward release is still triggered with no remaining reported travel. Captures retained; Abort then Pendant Mode.)
        o<mm_release_progress> endif
    o<mm_release_active> endwhile
o<mm_release> else
    o<mm_active> if [#<_hal[motion.probe-input]> NE 0]
        (ABORT,Probe is active before a mapper approach or transfer. No new move was issued. Abort then Pendant Mode.)
    o<mm_active> endif
    o<mm_motion> if [[#1 NE #<_x>] OR [#2 NE #<_y>] OR [#3 NE #<_z>]]
        o<mm_stage> if [#4 GE 2]
            #<_mp_stage> = [#4 - 2]
        o<mm_stage> endif
        (X increasing: physical LEFT / LinuxCNC +X; decreasing: physical RIGHT / LinuxCNC -X. Top approaches hold XY.)
        G38.3 X#1 Y#2 Z#3 F#5
        #<_mp_hit> = #5070
        o<mm_contact> if [#<_mp_hit> EQ 1]
            o<mm_obstruction> if [#4 EQ 0]
                o<mapper-record> call [3]
                o<mm_outside_z> if [[[#<_mp_phase> EQ 4] OR [#<_mp_phase> EQ 6]] AND [#1 EQ #<_mp_fx>] AND [#2 EQ #<_mp_fy>] AND [#3 LT #<_mp_fz>]]
                    (User-requested outside-edge Z recovery: retain trigger first, release UP then return to starting clearance; cancel.)
                    (UP / LinuxCNC +Z only; XY unchanged.)
                    o<mapper-move> call [#<_x>] [#<_y>] [#<_mp_clear>] [1] [#<_mp_fine>]
                    o<mapper-move> call [#<_x>] [#<_y>] [#<_mp_clear>] [4] [#<_mp_fine>]
                    o<mapper-record> call [5]
                    (ABORT,Unexpected outside-edge Z contact. Trigger retained and probe returned above the block to starting clearance. Scan cancelled; Abort then Pendant Mode.)
                o<mm_outside_z> endif
                (ABORT,Unexpected mapper transfer contact was saved and read back. No further motion was issued. Abort then Pendant Mode.)
            o<mm_obstruction> endif
            o<mapper-record> call [0]
        o<mm_contact> else
            o<mm_unlatched> if [#<_hal[motion.probe-input]> NE 0]
                o<mapper-record> call [2]
                (ABORT,CAPTURE FAILED - KEEP THE SETUP IN PLACE. Probe is active without a retained G38 contact. No miss or reconstructed trigger was accepted. Abort then Pendant Mode.)
            o<mm_unlatched> endif
            o<mm_fine_miss> if [#4 EQ 3]
                o<mapper-record> call [2]
                (ABORT,CAPTURE FAILED - KEEP THE SETUP IN PLACE. Fine re-touch had no contact; coarse data was not accepted as a measurement. Abort then Pendant Mode.)
            o<mm_fine_miss> endif
            o<mm_miss_kind> if [#4 EQ 2]
                o<mapper-record> call [1]
            o<mm_miss_kind> else
                o<mapper-record> call [2]
            o<mm_miss_kind> endif
        o<mm_contact> endif
    o<mm_motion> else
        o<mm_no_touch_motion> if [#4 GE 2]
            (ABORT,The requested probing target is already the current position. No contact was manufactured. Abort then Pendant Mode.)
        o<mm_no_touch_motion> endif
    o<mm_motion> endif
o<mm_release> endif
o<mapper-move> endsub
M2
